unverified AI claims or background daemons.\n\n### Blockers\nBlocked by foundational components in earlier workstreams (#1632, #1633, #1634).\n\n### Readiness Assessment\nblocked\n\n### Next Action\nImplement prior dependent steps in the orchestration pipeline before starting this task.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EffortlessMetrics/ripr-swarm/issues/comments/5008489143/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EffortlessMetrics/ripr-swarm/issues/comments/5008711070","html_url":"https://github.com/EffortlessMetrics/ripr-swarm/issues/1706#issuecomment-5008711070","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EffortlessMetrics/ripr-swarm/issues/1706","id":5008711070,"node_id":"IC_kwDOSiSx0c8AAAABKordng","user":{"login":"EffortlessSteven","id":15812269,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODEyMjY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15812269?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven","html_url":"https://github.com/EffortlessSteven","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-18T00:12:38Z","updated_at":"2026-07-18T00:12:38Z","body":"## Deep Research Follow-up\n\n**Reviewed:** 2026-07-17\n\n### Current Implementation State\nThe \\\ripr-swarm\\ project still uses some legacy active-goal singletons (e.g. \\^Gctive.toml\\ references) that need to be migrated.\n\n### Relevant Files\n- \\.ripr/goals/active.toml\\ — legacy global state file to be replaced.\n\n### Plan Review\nPortfolio-selected work identity is the direct implementation of #1697 (goals audit). It replaces the repository-wide default campaign with explicit \\PortfolioBasis\\ and \\SelectedWorkIdentity\\ references. This binds specific point-in-time contexts, allowing independent read-only waves and concurrent claims without requiring every issue to be tracked by a singleton campaign.\n\n### Blockers\nNone. This is the migration execution plan to replace the legacy \\^Gctive goal\\ fields.\n\n### Readiness Assessment\nready-to-implement\n\n### Next Action\nStart PR A to define the shared identity schemas, \\PortfolioBasis\\, and \\SelectedWorkIdentity\\ DTOs with legacy migration compatibility fields.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EffortlessMetrics/ripr-swarm/issues/comments/5008711070/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EffortlessMetrics/ripr-swarm/issues/comments/5009306618","html_url":"https://github.com/EffortlessMetrics/ripr-swarm/issues/1706#issuecomment-5009306618","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/EffortlessMetrics/ripr-swarm/issues/1706","id":5009306618,"node_id":"IC_kwDOSiSx0c8AAAABKpPz-g","user":{"login":"EffortlessSteven","id":15812269,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODEyMjY5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15812269?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/EffortlessSteven","html_url":"https://github.com/EffortlessSteven","followers_url